            <div class="guide-section"><div class="guide-section-header"><i class="fas fa-info-circle mr-2"></i>Ringkasan</div><div class="guide-section-body"><p class="mb-0">Module Notification mengelola notifikasi in-app dan push notification (FCM).</p></div></div>
            <div class="guide-section"><div class="guide-section-header"><i class="fas fa-list-ol mr-2"></i>Cara Penggunaan</div><div class="guide-section-body"><div class="guide-step"><div class="step-num">1</div><div class="step-body"><strong>Notifikasi In-App</strong><p>Ikon bell di navbar menampilkan jumlah unread.</p></div></div><div class="guide-step"><div class="step-num">2</div><div class="step-body"><strong>Push Notification</strong><p>Notifikasi FCM dikirim otomatis saat ada klaim hadiah baru.</p></div></div><div class="guide-step"><div class="step-num">3</div><div class="step-body"><strong>Kirim Custom Push</strong><p>Klik Custom Push untuk mengirim pesan manual.</p></div></div></div></div>